					<i class="frame-line frame-line--top" data-frame-line="top"></i>
					<i class="frame-line frame-line--right" data-frame-line="right"></i>
					<i class="frame-line frame-line--bottom" data-frame-line="bottom"></i>
					<i class="frame-line frame-line--left" data-frame-line="left"></i>
				</span>
				<div class="identity-panel identity-panel--statement" data-identity-panel="statement">
					<p>Independent media artist and researcher. Former Lecturer in Digital Media Technology.</p>
					<p>
						Current PhD-facing work centres on Unity-based interactive systems and game engines as
